  "implementation": [
    "completion_contract imports actual source_next_splits APIs, accepts active .11 only and extends eight older-proof dispatches to .11 through exact legacy views. Required set is exactly60, old48 plus12source-next roles from lane/tools discovery, source-next amendment and9explicit composition files.",
    "Generic lock/hash/family/schema checks precede full G validation. Old storage and source-next amendment paths are collected directly before late guard; all common exact refusal texts and final old/new validation layers remain.",
    "build_plan applies every sealed source_next record_update after source-preparation/storage layers, except expanded_implementation_inputs which is recomputed. The existing complete graph, waves, conflicts, briefs and team dispatch code remains; no source subset or cached golden output is substituted.",
    "verify_plan and team_policy use actual newG legacy/preparation APIs. Existing legacy .8 controls stay intact; verifier adds new amendment/lane/alias/G/C integrity paths. Current team projection covers797 and all7 preparation children.",
    "Old tools storage/preparation cases first restore live .11 to complete .10 using actual N, then execute their unchanged oldS/P negative semantics. Old module APIs and raw code/seals stay unchanged.",
    "Guard default-reader case, when actual lane exists, stops synthetic seal and reads live contract/plan to prove physical whole .10restoration; both prior missing-lane branch and explicit missing callback remain.",
    "Constructor tests read fixed immutable .10 prior3paths, retain scoped staged byte claims, refresh exact guard-test bootstrap SHA, and stop the test seal for default physical lock and full snapshot equality to actual live .11 state. A scoped loader-only Path.is_file false value retains exact missing-role refusal without source edits."
  ],
